leware.before_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.before_model"], ["model"], ["HumanInTheLoopMiddleware.after_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["ToolCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["InterjectionMiddleware.after_model"], ["TodoListMiddleware.after_model"], ["tools"], ["SummarizationMiddleware.before_model"], ["InterjectionMiddleware.before_model"], ["TaskClassifierMiddleware.before_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.before_model"], ["model"], ["HumanInTheLoopMiddleware.after_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["ToolCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["InterjectionMiddleware.after_model"], ["TodoListMiddleware.after_model"], ["tools"], ["SummarizationMiddleware.before_model"], ["InterjectionMiddleware.before_model"], ["TaskClassifierMiddleware.before_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.before_model"], ["model"], ["HumanInTheLoopMiddleware.after_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["ToolCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["InterjectionMiddleware.after_model"], ["TodoListMiddleware.after_model"], ["tools"], ["SummarizationMiddleware.before_model"], ["InterjectionMiddleware.before_model"], ["TaskClassifierMiddleware.before_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.before_model"], ["model"], ["HumanInTheLoopMiddleware.after_model"], ["ModelCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["ToolCallLimitMiddleware.after_model"], ["InterjectionMiddleware.after_model"], ["TodoListMiddleware.after_model"], ["CurrentTurnRubricMiddleware.after_agent"]], "results": [{"toolCallId": "call_93fa25d3d8554fc189b3e406", "name": "execute", "content": "---\nname: count-sum\ndescription: 对含count列的UTF-8 CSV求和，拒绝负数与非整数；仅在用户明确要求汇总计数CSV时触发。\nmetadata:\n  capability_id: WX-S016\n  version: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# Count Sum\n\n## 触发条件\n\n当且仅当用户同时满足以下条件时加载本技能：\n\n- 明确提到“汇总/求和/统计”与“CSV/表格文件”；\n- 文件中预期存在名为 `count` 的表头；\n- 目标是得到非负整数总和并以 JSON 返回。\n\n不应触发的反例：普通问候、不含 `count` 列的CSV、需要联网或安装依赖的任务、要求修改原文件而非只读汇总。\n\n## 执行流程\n\n1. 确认输入文件可读且为 UTF-8 CSV，包含 `count` 表头。\n2. 在沙箱内运行：`python3 scripts/sum_counts.py <csv_path>`。\n3. 解析标准输出的 JSON `{\"total\": n}`；非零退出码视为失败并向用户说明原因。\n4. 不写入原文件，不安装额外包，不访问网络。\n\n## 资源\n\n- `scripts/sum_counts.py`：纯标准库实现，参数为CSV路径，成功打印JSON，失败以非零退出并输出错误到stderr。\n- `references/validation.md`：验证清单与已执行的正反例证据。\n- `assets/example_positive.csv`、`assets/example_negative.csv`：用于复现验证的最小样例。\n\n## 边界\n\n- 仅支持整数；浮点、空值、缺失列均报错。\n- 任何负数立即失败，不会返回部分结果。\n- 草稿包不等于已发布技能；需管理员显式导入后才可被调用。\n\n[Command succeeded with exit code 0]", "status": "success"}, {"toolCallId": "call_74b29dfe4f0543c1a026816d", "name": "execute", "content": "{\"total\": 3}\n\n[Command succeeded with exit code 0]", "status": "success"}, {"toolCallId": "call_d905f841230043498c3424fa", "name": "execute", "content": "\n[Command succeeded with exit code 0]", "status": "success"}, {"toolCallId": "call_48ea4f30f3824b17a7a0d040", "name": "wx_artifact_publish", "content": "{\"publishId\": \"988e6b4c-e6c0-4ffd-8235-6336bcfdd7ed\", \"status\": \"staged\", \"sha256\": \"7cc5a42716610df66f175b7cba447695d43f6476eab93e2f4e0c03875c30112d\", \"sizeBytes\": 122}", "status": "success"}], "lastMessage": {"type": "ai", "content": "附件 `counts.csv` 的 count 列汇总结果为 **3**。\n\n已将真实计算结果与所用脚本路径 `/skills/count-sum/scripts/sum_counts.py` 写入 `report.md` 并完成交付。"}, "stateKeys": ["messages", "skills_metadata", "native_skills_binding", "files", "thread_tool_call_count", "run_tool_call_count", "thread_model_call_count", "run_model_call_count", "rubric", "_rubric_status", "_rubric_iterations", "_rubric_evaluations", "_current_grading_run_id", "_active_rubric"]}